// input: after idr-isolate
// main is not total; each function idr-isolate outlines from it is, since
// its own body has no loop: whether a call of it may diverge is what it
// reaches (idr-effects). The outlined functions are found by name, in
// whatever order the pass inserts them. main's only fact is the Idris
// definition it is an instance of.
